{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24813","headline":"赠毛仙翁 · 王起","name":"赠毛仙翁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冰霜肌骨称童年，羽驾何由到俗间。\n丹竈化金留秘诀，仙宫嗽玉叩玄关。\n壶中世界青天近，洞里烟霞白日闲。\n若许随师去尘网，愿陪鸾鹤向三山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24813.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24813","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}